{"id": "DeHUaCoPFTV", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"PLUGIN\" to get these 11 free Claude plugins for your job role.\n\nAnthropic just dropped 11 free plugins that turn Claude into an expert at your actual job.\n\nEach plugin is built for a specific job role.\n\nLike sales, marketing, finance, legal, and product management.\n\nAnd each one comes with its own set of skills.\n\nAnd the best part is that they're built on how Anthropic's own team actually does these tasks.\n\nSo Claude follows the same workflows they use internally.\n\nSo if you're in sales, it researches your prospects.\n\nIt preps you for calls and drafts your outreach.\n\nAnd if you're in marketing, it plans your campaigns.\n\nIt writes your email sequences and even runs a full SEO audit.\n\nAnd if you're in finance, it keeps track of every transaction.\n\nAnd it helps build your financial statements.\n\nPlus it connects directly to the tools you already use for your job.\n\nLike HubSpot, Notion, and Slack.\n\nSo it can get all the real time information it needs.\n\nThink of it like hiring a specialist who already knows how your whole department works.\n\nNo more explaining your job to Claude every time.\n\nPick your role's plugin and start using it right away.\n\n#claudecode #claudeplugins #claudeai #aiforjob #aiagents", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1791207034, "like_count": 2311, "comment_count": 3663, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1739581068172364a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 66.655, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOocIUOoIiDmOuAj8XAeFV1-KcxR43cUiopGVzZkXHXirtmtO6_fdDT9WD8kKefHGayMSedRhLNLOgb9XL2NEn7Mr_zFu3OROCWnKw.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=AdpyAItBAbEPVxRajAK0_zReLixUI1lTkAmXs1n4iS2Odz-llP-Cj_qMlaaFlPXfOmQ&_nc_s